{
  "vcon": "0.4.0",
  "uuid": "3f802bfa-91d8-896c-b8e0-4dd1e7747790",
  "created_at": "2026-03-11T11:44:58-04:00",
  "subject": "Inbound call, Public Works",
  "parties": [
    {
      "name": "Brendan Gallagher",
      "role": "resident",
      "validation": "synthetic"
    },
    {
      "name": "Kevin Sousa",
      "role": "clerk",
      "validation": "synthetic"
    }
  ],
  "dialog": [
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-03-11T11:41:50-04:00",
      "duration": 3,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Public Works, this is Kevin."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-03-11T11:41:53-04:00",
      "duration": 7,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Hello, Kevin. Good morning. My name is Brendan Gallagher. I call about a streetlight."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-03-11T11:42:00-04:00",
      "duration": 4,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Sure thing, Mr. Gallagher. What's it doing?"
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-03-11T11:42:04-04:00",
      "duration": 9,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "The light is on all day. Morning, afternoon, all the time. It does not turn off. Three days now."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-03-11T11:42:13-04:00",
      "duration": 6,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Ah, a day burner. Okay. So it's lit right now, in broad daylight."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-03-11T11:42:19-04:00",
      "duration": 9,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Yes. Right now, I look out the window, it is on. Very bright, with the sun. It is a waste, no?"
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-03-11T11:42:28-04:00",
      "duration": 5,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Yeah, it is. Let me get the location. Where's the pole?"
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-03-11T11:42:33-04:00",
      "duration": 5,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "It is in front of my house. 294 Kingston Avenue."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-03-11T11:42:38-04:00",
      "duration": 5,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Two ninety-four Kingston Avenue. That's up on the Hill, right?"
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-03-11T11:42:43-04:00",
      "duration": 8,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Yes, Historic Hill. Please, can you say again the number? I want to be sure you have it right."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-03-11T11:42:51-04:00",
      "duration": 5,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Two, nine, four, Kingston Avenue. Got it written down."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-03-11T11:42:56-04:00",
      "duration": 3,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Yes, that is correct. Thank you."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-03-11T11:42:59-04:00",
      "duration": 8,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Is there a number on the pole itself? Sometimes there's a little tag, a few feet up."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-03-11T11:43:07-04:00",
      "duration": 8,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Um, I do not see. I can go outside and look. But it is high, maybe I cannot read."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-03-11T11:43:15-04:00",
      "duration": 8,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "No, don't worry about it. The address will do. Is the light flickering at all, or just solid on?"
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-03-11T11:43:23-04:00",
      "duration": 10,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Solid. Not flicker. Just on, on, on. I ask you, please, can a crew come and check the pole? Maybe the sensor is broken."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-03-11T11:43:33-04:00",
      "duration": 16,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "That's probably what it is, the photocell. I'll put in a request for a crew to look at the pole and the fixture. Streetlights get done in the order they come in, so it might be a few days."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-03-11T11:43:49-04:00",
      "duration": 11,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "A few days. Okay. It is already three days, so I wait a little more. It is not a big problem, but it is annoying."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-03-11T11:44:00-04:00",
      "duration": 9,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Understood. I've got you down for the all-day light at 294 Kingston. Do you want a call back when it's fixed?"
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-03-11T11:44:09-04:00",
      "duration": 5,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Yes, if you can. My number is four-oh-one, five-five-five, zero-one-eight-zero."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-03-11T11:44:14-04:00",
      "duration": 3,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Four-oh-one, five-five-five, zero-one-eight-zero. Okay, that's in."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-03-11T11:44:17-04:00",
      "duration": 14,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Yes, correct. Thank you. Excuse me, one more thing. Today my son, he lost his first tooth. For me, this is the most important news of the day. More important than the light."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-03-11T11:44:31-04:00",
      "duration": 5,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Well, that beats a streetlight any day. Congratulations to him."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-03-11T11:44:36-04:00",
      "duration": 8,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Thank you. So, the crew will check the pole, at 294 Kingston Avenue. I say it right?"
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-03-11T11:44:44-04:00",
      "duration": 7,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "You said it right. Request is logged, and someone will be out to look at it."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-03-11T11:44:51-04:00",
      "duration": 4,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Okay. Thank you, Kevin. Have a good day."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-03-11T11:44:55-04:00",
      "duration": 3,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "You too, Mr. Gallagher. Take care."
    }
  ],
